Dr. M. Srinivas, Member, NITI Aayog, interacted with the Safai Mitras of NITI Aayog as part of the ongoing Swachhotsav, emphasising the importance of prioritising their health, well-being and healthy dietary habits.



During the interaction, Dr. Srinivas also sensitised the Safai Mitras about their legitimate entitlements under the Employees’ State Insurance Corporation (ESIC) scheme and explained the benefits available to them.



The interaction was attended by Safai Mitras and managerial staff of NITI Aayog, highlighting the importance of awareness, welfare and dignity of sanitation workers.



